    <string name="ui_no_registration_advertising_or_a_00a2f4" formatted="false">No registration, advertising or analytics transmission. Recipes and kitchen data stay on this device. English photo recognition runs on device. Website import contacts the requested site and redirects. Voice is push-to-talk; your speech provider may process audio online. DishNest stores no raw audio. When configured, billing sends Amazon user and receipt identifiers to the verification service and Amazon; signed receipts are stored privately for restore and offline access. Cloud backup is not connected.</string>
    <string name="ui_no_store_prices_free_trials_or_p_dbbbec" formatted="false">Subscriptions renew through Amazon until cancelled in your Amazon subscription settings. Amazon shows the applicable price, billing period and any offer before you confirm. A lifetime purchase is a single payment. No trial is promised by DishNest.</string>
