    <string name="ui_off_by_default_counts_contain_no_6ec589" formatted="false">Off by default. Counts contain no recipe content, audio, names or identifiers. Nothing is transmitted. Switching off deletes these counters. Purchase and trial conversion counts are inactive while billing is disabled.</string>
